Privacy Policy for the app GTKBOT
Last updated:7/11/2026

Data we collect
GTKBOT stores your Discord user ID, username, points and info regarding the bots intended features. and the IDs of servers and channels where it is used. It does not collect any personal information outside discord.

How we use it
This data is used only to provide the bot’s features, such as comnmands, leaderboards, points, ect. We do not sell your data or use it for advertising.

Sharing
We do not share your data with third parties, except for our hosting/database provider, Bot-Hosting, which stores it on our behalf.

Retention
Data is kept while the bot is in your server or until you ask us to delete it. When the bot is removed from a server, that server’s data is deleted within 30 days.

Your rights / deletio
To request access to or deletion of your data, contact recoolestt@gmail.com or message @recoolest on discord

Security
We take reasonable measures to protect stored data, but no system is completely secure.

Children
The bot is intended for users who meet Discord’s minimum age requirement (13+). We do not knowingly collect data from younger users nor do we intentionally allow younger users to use the app.

Changes
We may update this policy and will change the date above when we do.

